# nektos/act (local GitHub Actions)
.secrets
.artifacts/

# Cross-repo checkout created only in CI (ci.yml "Checkout node-scala" step, for the
# OpenAPI-spec path-conformance check). It is a sibling repo's tree, not DecentralChain
# source, so it must never be tracked, linted, or format-checked -- biome honors this via
# useIgnoreFile, which is what stopped `biome format .` from failing on node-scala's own
# unformatted JSON (lang/doc/*.json etc.) after the CI checkout landed it under the root.
_node-scala/

